    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Any positive integer raised to the power of 0 is equal to 1.\nA number raised to the power of 1 is the number itself.\nSince the base is 1, no matter what the exponent is, the result will always be 1.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{{1}}$.",
