    "prompt": "Please solve the following mathematical problem and provide the final answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The volume of the cylinder shown is $45\\pi$ cubic cm. What is the height in centimeters of the cylinder? [asy]\nsize(120);\ndraw(shift(2.2,0)*yscale(0.3)*Circle((0,0), 1.2));\n\ndraw((1,0)--(1,-2));\ndraw((3.4,0)--(3.4,-2));\n\ndraw((1,-2)..(2.2,-2.36)..(3.4,-2));\n\nlabel(\"$h$\",midpoint((3.4,0)--(3.4,-2)),E);\n\ndraw (((2.2,0)--(3.4,0)));\n\nlabel(\"$r=3$\",midpoint((2.2,0)--(3.4,0)),N);\n\n[/asy]\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format, where the content inside the braces is the exact mathematical expression or number. For example: \\boxed{{42}}. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
