In the context of multiple-choice questions where one option is the \"most likely correct,\" option G is the most direct and widely accepted statement about the relationship between chromosomal instability and cancer. While it's a complex process, chromosomal instability is considered a driver of cancer.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{G}$.",
