    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which describes an African butterfly species that exists in two strikingly different color patterns?\n\nOptions: \nA. directional selection\nB. Natural selection\nC. artificial selection\nD. Divergent selection\nE. Convergent evolution\nF. Genetic drift\nG. Balanced selection\nH. stabilizing selection\nI. disruptive selection\nJ. Sexual selection\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
