    "global index": "MMLUPro_biology_3200",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The average birth weight for human babies is about 3 kg. Which of the following terms best describes this?\n\nOptions: \nA. disruptive selection\nB. sexual selection\nC. bottleneck effect\nD. non-random mating\nE. stabilizing selection\nF. genetic drift\nG. directional selection\nH. founder effect\nI. diversifying selection\nJ. artificial selection\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
