    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To determine the correct answer, we reverse-complement the antisense strand to get the sense strand: 3' TAC CTA TTT CAA AAT TTG TCT CTC CTT AGA 5'. The mRNA transcribed from this strand will be 5' AUG GAU AAA GUU UUA AAC AGA GAG GAA UCU 3'. Translating this mRNA sequence gives the polypeptide chain Met-Asp-Lys-Val-Leu-Asn-Arg-Glu-Glu-Ser.\n\nThe correct answer is \\boxed{G}.",
