    "global index": "MMLUPro_chemistry_4354",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A silver dollar weighs about 0.943 ounces. Express this weightin grams, in kilograms, and in milligrams.\n\nOptions: \nA. 32.73 g, .03273 kg, 32,730 mg\nB. 31.73 g, .03173 kg, 31,730 mg\nC. 26.73 g, .02673 kg, 26,730 mg\nD. 24.73 g, .02473 kg, 24,730 mg\nE. 23.73 g, .02373 kg, 23,730 mg\nF. 27.73 g, .02773 kg, 27,730 mg\nG. 28.73 g, .02873 kg, 28,730 mg\nH. 29.73 g, .02973 kg, 29,730 mg\nI. 30.73 g, .03073 kg, 30,730 mg\nJ. 25.73 g, .02573 kg, 25,730 mg\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
