    "global index": "MMLUPro_math_7720",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Tisha wrote the following riddle to her friend: I have 2 faces, no vertices, and I can roll. What am I? What is the answer to the riddle?\n\nOptions: \nA. hexagonal prism\nB. torus\nC. cone\nD. prism\nE. sphere\nF. rectangular prism\nG. pentagonal prism\nH. cube\nI. cylinder\nJ. pyramid\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
