    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A completely submerged object always displaces its own\n\nOptions: \nA. pressure of fluid.\nB. surface area of fluid.\nC. density of fluid.\nD. weight of fluid.\nE. depth of fluid.\nF. temperature of fluid.\nG. All of these.\nH. viscosity of fluid.\nI. mass of fluid.\nJ. volume of fluid.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
