    "global index": "MMLUPro_physics_8382",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Identify $\\mathrm{{X}}$ in the following nuclear reactions: (a) ${{ }}^1 \\mathrm{{H}}+$ ${{ }}^9 \\mathrm{{Be}} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{{X}}+\\mathrm{{n}} ;$ (b) ${{ }}^{{12}} \\mathrm{{C}}+{{ }}^1 \\mathrm{{H}} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{{X}} ;$ (c) ${{ }}^{{15}} \\mathrm{{~N}}+{{ }}^1 \\mathrm{{H}} \\rightarrow{{ }}^4 \\mathrm{{He}}+\\mathrm{{X}}$. Appendix F will help.\n\nOptions: \nA. ${{ }}^{{14}} \\mathrm{{~N}}$\nB. ${{ }}^{{11}} \\mathrm{{~B}}$\nC. ${{ }}^8 \\mathrm{{~B}}$\nD.  ${{ }}^9 \\mathrm{{~B}}$\nE. ${{ }}^{{16}} \\mathrm{{~O}}$\nF. ${{ }}^{{10}} \\mathrm{{~B}}$\nG. ${{ }}^6 \\mathrm{{~Li}}$\nH. ${{ }}^7 \\mathrm{{~Li}}$\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
