    "global index": "MMLUPro_physics_8278",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: As more lamps are connected in parallel in a circuit the current in the power source\n\nOptions: \nA. increases.\nB. remains much the same.\nC. Becomes erratic.\nD. Is halved.\nE. Varies inversely with the number of lamps.\nF. Doubles.\nG. Is not affected by the number of lamps.\nH. Is dependent on the type of lamp.\nI. decreases.\nJ. Need more information.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
