      "generated_answer": "The maximum number of handshakes between 50 men, where each shakes hands with every other, is given by the combination formula \\( \\binom{n}{2} = \\frac{n(n-1)}{2} \\) because each handshake involves a pair of men. Plugging in \\( n = 50 \\), the maximum number of handshakes is \\( \\frac{50 \\times 49}{2} = 1225 \\). \n\nThus, the correct answer is \\(\\boxed{C}\\).",
