    "global index": "MathQA_1589",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: if a certain coin is flipped , the probability that the coin will land heads is 1 / 2 . if the coin is flipped 5 times , what is the probability that it will land heads up on the first 3 flips and not on the last 2 flips ?\n\nOptions: \nA. 3 / 5\nB. 1 / 2\nC. 1 / 5\nD. 1 / 8\nE. 1 / 32\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The probability of getting heads on a single flip is $1/2$. The probability of not getting heads (i.e., getting tails) is also $1/2$. Since each flip is an independent event, we multiply the probabilities of each desired outcome together. For the first 3 flips to be heads, the probability is $(1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2)$. For the last 2 flips to not be heads (i.e., tails), the probability is $(1/2) * (1/2)$. Therefore, the probability of the specific sequence of 3 heads followed by 2 tails is $(1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2) = (1/2)^5 = 1/32$.\n\nThe probability of getting heads on the first flip is $1/2$.\nThe probability of getting heads on the second flip is $1/2$.\nThe probability of getting heads on the third flip is $1/2$.\nThe probability of not getting heads on the fourth flip (i.e., getting tails) is $1 - 1/2 = 1/2$.\nThe probability of not getting heads on the fifth flip (i.e., getting tails) is $1 - 1/2 = 1/2$.\n\nSince these are independent events, the probability of all these events happening in the specified order is the product of their individual probabilities:\n$P(\\text{HHHTT}) = P(H) * P(H) * P(H) * P(T) * P(T)$\n$P(\\text{HHHTT}) = (1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2) * (1/2)$\n$P(\\text{HHHTT}) = (1/2)^5$\n$P(\\text{HHHTT}) = 1/32$\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{E}$.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 159,
        "output_tokens": 432,
        "total_tokens": 591
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "error": null
