    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: LC oscillators are used for produce a waveform with frequency ranging from\n\nOptions: \nA. 1 kHz to 100 kHz\nB. 500 MHz to 1 GHz\nC. 1 Hz to 1 kHz\nD. 1 KHz to 1 MHz\nE. 10 kHz to 100 MHz\nF. 100 KHz to 500 MHz\nG. 1 MHz to 1 GHz\nH. 1MHz to 500 MHz\nI. 1MHz to 100 GHz\nJ. 1 GHz to 10 GHz\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
