    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10436",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In binary number system the first digit (bit) from right to left is called as\n\nOptions: \nA. First Significant Bit\nB. MSB, Most Significant Bit\nC. LSB, Least Significant Bit\nD. Last Bit\nE. Binary Digit\nF. Initial Bit\nG. Binary Significant Bit\nH. Bit Zero\nI. First Bit\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
