    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10770",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Using the definition of the unilateral Z transform, F (z) = ^\\infty\\sum_n=0 f[n] z^-n. find the z - transform of the step-sequence f[n] = u[n].\n\nOptions: \nA. [1 / (z - 1)]\nB. [z / (1 + z)]\nC. [z^2 / (z - 1)]\nD. [1 / (2 - z)]\nE. [(z - 1) / z]\nF. [1 / (z^2 - 1)]\nG. [1 / (1 - z)]\nH. [z / (1 - z)]\nI. [z / (z - 1)]\nJ. [z / (z^2 - 1)]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The step-sequence is defined as $f[n] = u[n]$, where $u[n] = 1$ for $n \\ge 0$ and $u[n] = 0$ for $n < 0$.\nThe unilateral Z-transform is given by $F(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} f[n] z^{-n}$.\n\nSubstituting $f[n] = u[n]$ into the Z-transform definition, we get:\n$F(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} u[n] z^{-n}$\nSince $u[n] = 1$ for $n \\ge 0$, the summation becomes:\n$F(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} (1) z^{-n}$\n$F(z) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} (z^{-1})^n$\n\nThis is a geometric series with the first term $a = (z^{-1})^0 = 1$ and the common ratio $r = z^{-1}$.\nThe sum of an infinite geometric series is given by $\\frac{a}{1 - r}$, provided that $|r| < 1$.\nIn this case, the sum converges if $|z^{-1}| < 1$, which means $|z| > 1$.\n\nSo, $F(z) = \\frac{1}{1 - z^{-1}}$\n\nTo simplify this expression, we can multiply the numerator and the denominator by 'z':\n$F(z) = \\frac{1 \\cdot z}{(1 - z^{-1}) \\cdot z}$\n$F(z) = \\frac{z}{z - z \\cdot z^{-1}}$\n$F(z) = \\frac{z}{z - 1}$\n\nComparing this result with the given options, we find that option I matches our derived Z-transform.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{I}$.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 234,
        "output_tokens": 421,
        "total_tokens": 655
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
