    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Find the inverse Laplace transform f(t) = L^-1 {{log [(s + 1) / (s - 1)]}}, s > 1.\n\nOptions: \nA. (1 - e^(-2t)) / t\nB. (2 sinh t) / t^2\nC. (2 tanh t) / t\nD. (2 sinh t) / t\nE. (2 tanh t) * t\nF. (2 cosh t) / t\nG. (2 sinh t) * t\nH. (2 e^t) / t\nI. (2 / (e^t - e^(-t)))\nJ. (2 cosh t) * t\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To find the inverse Laplace transform of $\\log\\left(\\frac{s+1}{s-1}\\right)$, we can use the property of Laplace transforms that $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{d}{ds}F(s)\\right\\} = -tf(t)$.\n\nLet $F(s) = \\log\\left(\\frac{s+1}{s-1}\\right) = \\log(s+1) - \\log(s-1)$.\nThen, $\\frac{d}{ds}F(s) = \\frac{1}{s+1} - \\frac{1}{s-1}$.\n\nWe know that $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s-a}\\right\\} = e^{at}$.\nTherefore, $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s+1}\\right\\} = e^{-t}$ (since $a = -1$) and $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s-1}\\right\\} = e^{t}$ (since $a = 1$).\n\nSo, $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{d}{ds}F(s)\\right\\} = L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s+1} - \\frac{1}{s-1}\\right\\} = L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s+1}\\right\\} - L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{1}{s-1}\\right\\} = e^{-t} - e^{t}$.\n\nUsing the property $L^{-1}\\left\\{\\frac{d}{ds}F(s)\\right\\} = -tf(t)$, we have:\n$-tf(t) = e^{-t} - e^{t}$\n$tf(t) = -(e^{-t} - e^{t}) = e^{t} - e^{-t}$\n$f(t) = \\frac{e^{t} - e^{-t}}{t}$\n\nWe know that the hyperbolic sine function is defined as $\\sinh t = \\frac{e^{t} - e^{-t}}{2}$.\nTherefore, $e^{t} - e^{-t} = 2 \\sinh t$.\n\nSubstituting this into the expression for $f(t)$:\n$f(t) = \\frac{2 \\sinh t}{t}$.\n\nTherefore, the inverse Laplace transform is $\\frac{2 \\sinh t}{t}$.\n\nComparing this with the given options:\nA. $(1 - e^{-2t}) / t$\nB. $(2 \\sinh t) / t^2$\nC. $(2 \\tanh t) / t$\nD. $(2 \\sinh t) / t$\nE. $(2 \\tanh t) * t$\nF. $(2 \\cosh t) / t$\nG. $(2 \\sinh t) * t$\nH. $(2 e^t) / t$\nI. $(2 / (e^t - e^(-t)))$\nJ. $(2 \\cosh t) * t$\n\nThe correct option is D.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{D}$.",
      "success": true,
