    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Obtain the partial-fraction expansion of F(s) = [(s + 2) / {{(s + 1)^2 (s + 3)}}]\n\nOptions: \nA. F(s) = [(1 / 5) / (s + 1)] + [(2 / 5) / (s + 1)^2] - [(2 / 5) / (s + 3)]\nB. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)] - [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)^2] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 3)]\nC. F(s) = [(3 / 4) / (s + 1)] - [(1 / 8) / (s + 1)^2] - [(5 / 8) / (s + 3)]\nD. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)^2] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 1)] - [(1 / 4) / (s + 3)]\nE. F(s) = [(1 / 6) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 3) / (s + 1)^2] - [(1 / 2) / (s + 3)]\nF. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 3)]\nG. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 1)^2] - [(1 / 4) / (s + 3)]\nH. F(s) = [(1 / 3) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 3) / (s + 1)^2] + [(1 / 3) / (s + 3)]\nI. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 6) / (s + 1)^2] + [(1 / 3) / (s + 3)]\nJ. F(s) = [(1 / 2) / (s + 1)^2] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 1)] + [(1 / 4) / (s + 3)]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
