onversion time $T_{conv} = 0.0032$s. Sampling period $T_s = 0.1$s.\nThe ramp slope ($500 \\, \\text{V/sec}$) easily tracks the maximum input signal slope ($2\\pi \\, \\text{V/sec}$).\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{G}$.",
