    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Determine the Fourier transform of the function f(t) = e^-2t sin(6t - 18) u(t - 3) where u(t) is the unit step function. Note: F[e^-\\alphat(sin \\omega_0t)u(t)] = [\\omega_0 / {{(\\alpha + j\\omega)^2 + \\omega_0^2}}]\n\nOptions: \nA. 6e^-6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω - 2)^2 + 36}}]\nB. 6e^-2 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 36}}]\nC. 3e^-6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 36}}]\nD. 6e^-18 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 36}}]\nE. 6e^-6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 72}}]\nF. 6e^-6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 36}}]\nG. 3e^-2 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 18}}]\nH. 6e^-6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 18}}]\nI. 6 [e^-3jω / {{(jω + 2)^2 + 36}}]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
