    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10454",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A 200-kva, [(13,200) / (2,200)]-volt, 60-cps, single-phase transformer has the following test data: Volts Amp Watts Frequency Volts Open circuit 2,200 3.1 1550 60 cps 12,800 Short circuit 210 90.9 2500 60 cps Determine the parameters of the T-equivalent circuit when referred to the low voltage winding.\n\nOptions: \nA. Turns ratio = 6.00, R = 2900.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.55 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.400 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 710.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.320 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.10 ohm.\nB. Turns ratio = 5.70, R = 3100.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.45 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.380 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 730.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.295 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.35 ohm.\nC. Turns ratio = 5.82, R = 3120.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.31 × 10^-3 mho\nD. Turns ratio = 5.90, R = 3300.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.35 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.320 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 720.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.305 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.25 ohm.\nE. Turns ratio = 4.82, R = 4120.0 ohms, Y_oc = 2.41 × 10^-3 mho\nF. Turns ratio = 6.82, R = 2120.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.91 × 10^-3 mho\nG. Turns ratio = 5.82, R = 3120.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.41 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.374 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 727.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.303 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.28 ohm.\nH. Turns ratio = 5.82, R = 4000.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.25 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.450 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 700.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.250 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.80 ohm.\nI. Turns ratio = 6.00, R = 3500.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.10 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.200 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 800.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.350 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.50 ohm.\nJ. Turns ratio = 5.50, R = 3200.0 ohms, Y_oc = 1.50 × 10^-3 mho, |b_mag| = 1.250 × 10^-3 mho, |X_mag| = 750.0 ohms, r_1' + r_2 = 0.310 ohm, |X_sc| = 2.30 ohm.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
