    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The problem requires calculating the output horsepower, torque, percent efficiency, and power factor of an induction motor given test data. The provided options are sets of these calculated values. By performing the necessary calculations based on the given no-load and load test data, we can determine which option best matches the results. Through detailed calculations, option I is found to closely align with the expected values for horsepower output, torque, efficiency, and power factor.\n\nThe final answer is $\\boxed{I}$.",
