    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Bu is often late for appointments but says it's because she had more important things on her mind. This is an example of which coping strategy?\n\nOptions: \nA. Projection\nB. Regression\nC. Immunization\nD. Assimilation\nE. Avoidance\nF. Displacement\nG. Denial\nH. Accommodation\nI. Sublimation\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
