    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Do traits change with age?\n\nOptions: \nA. They change a little\nB. They only change due to major life events\nC. Only after the age of 60\nD. Only in childhood\nE. Only for women\nF. They change drastically\nG. No\nH. Only for men\nI. They change quite a lot\nJ. They don't change at all\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
