    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A source emits a sound from one medium with a certain velocity, intensity, frequency and wavelength. When the sound exits the first medium and enters a denser medium, all of the following changes EXCEPT:\n\nOptions: \nA. tone\nB. amplitude\nC. wavelength\nD. direction\nE. pitch\nF. frequency\nG. resonance\nH. volume\nI. intensity\nJ. velocity\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
