    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The group that permits analysis of the entire natural history of HIV/AIDS is:\n\nOptions: \nA. Non-seroconverters\nB. Seroconverters\nC. Short-term survivors with low levels of CD4+ cells\nD. Long-term survivors\nE. Long-term survivors with high levels of CD4+ cells\nF. Persistent seronegatives\nG. Short-term survivors\nH. Seroconverters with fluctuating levels of CD4+ cells\nI. Persistent seropositives\nJ. Long-term survivors with low levels of CD4+ cells\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
