    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Why do vigorous CD8 cell responses in chronically infected HIV-positive individuals fail to eliminate the virus?\n\nOptions: \nA. Inadequate MHC Class I presentation\nB. Suboptimal CTL\nC. Overproduction of interferon gamma\nD. Overactive T-helper cells\nE. Absence of dendritic cells\nF. CTL exhaustion\nG. Presence of neutralizing antibodies\nH. Epitope escape\nI. Insufficient natural killer cell activity\nJ. Lack of B cell response\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
